      <rules>
        <rule name="Chieftain’s Aura" id="0eb0-8c6c-3ef8-77e2" hidden="false">
          <description>While a Merovingian chieftain still has all his hit points (and all his hair), his Franks’ morale cannot be dented, and they automatically pass all their Morale checks.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Difficult Terrain Experts" id="625a-876e-c2c3-0bbb" hidden="false">
          <description>Merovingian infantry don’t take penalties when moving through the following difficult terrain: forests and marshes.


hey are also excellent swimmers. Add +2 to all their swimming rolls.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
